{"obsah":"<p>This weekend was again a bit nomadic. Vlasta loaded up young guns Matouš Balík and Tobík Dolák and set off, somewhat unexpectedly, towards Pelhřimov, where another edition of the Pelhřimov Records was taking place. Although our team has many registered records, we had never been to this event. Moreover, the invitation came only a few days in advance. On the packed square it looked like rain at first, but in the end we rode the whole show in sunshine right on the main stage, and we even managed to use our trailer for jumping over and dropping off. People enjoyed the show and hopefully we'll be invited to future editions.</p>\n\n<p>But the Pelhřimov exhibition might not have happened at all – it was only thanks to Martin Šimůnek's freed-up schedule that the Travčice exhibition worked out too. Martin and unicyclist Dominik also had a packed crowd, even though it was just a small village sports event. They also definitely sent more photos than Vlasta's part of the team, but hopefully something else will arrive.</p>\n\n<p>Before the exhibition Vlasta went to check out the new Rock Machine bikes, which got new colours, and a luxurious new Enduro and E-bike were on display too. Thanks to LSK for the invitation.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-06-12-v-13.04.20.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-06-12-v-13.04.20.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237526\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2023-06-12-v-13.04.14.web